      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:15",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲡⲛⲁⲩ ⲛⲧⲟϥ ⲛⲧⲁⲡ**ϩⲉⲕⲁⲧⲟⲛⲧⲁⲣⲭⲟⲥ** ⲉⲓ ⲛⲁⲕ ⲡⲉϫⲁⲕ ϫⲉϯⲛⲏⲩ ⲧⲁⲣⲡⲁϩⲣⲉ ⲉⲣⲟϥ ·",
      "english": "Yet in that very hour wherein the centurion came to Thee Thou didst say, 'I am coming, I will heal him.'",
